WEBVTT

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:04.340
Tremble in dizziness!

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:07.800
Crush and destroy the insects dwelling within your body!

00:02:08.370 --> 00:02:10.800
Deny a false peace...

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:15.460
That's a fine woman.

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:20.820
It'd be such a waste to let this cult have her.

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:26.080
There's no fixed origin of the wavering light!

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:28.220
Eyes...

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:32.280
Glimmer, shimmer.

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:48.680
Let the tremors of love become even further distorted.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:52.970
Let the vibrato of the song of marriage bring forth blessings!

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:10.750
Now then, the wedding ceremony goes like this:

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:18.000
First, the bride and groom kiss to symbolize their vows.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:19.260
Smooch.

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:35.890
How intense! I'm jealous.

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:41.660
After kissing, they head to the top floor.

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:51.000
Mr. Dizziness will insert his pendant into the door.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.250
But wait a minute.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:56.500
Allow me to add some entertainment to this ceremony.

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:08.310
What's going on?

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:11.390
Fluffy! Pretty!

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:39.180
Hey, what are you doing sprawled on the floor?

00:04:56.140 --> 00:04:57.690
Are you perhaps...

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:01.730
an extraordinarily fine woman?!

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:02.760
Huh?

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:07.650
What a strong tremor.

00:05:08.150 --> 00:05:09.780
The poison didn't work?

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:14.830
Huh?

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:18.540
Glimmer, shimmer!

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:26.590
Dizzy, dizzy.

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:35.100
Sinful woman,

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:39.850
I've found the answer to your rejection of the Trembling Marriage!

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:43.330
Her immobile roots are dyed in sin.

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:46.230
We must separate her from the source of that sin.

00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:48.130
She will be executed tomorrow!

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:49.700
At daybreak!

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:56.440
I'm still dizzy.

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:01.160
Who would've guessed that the founder's bride was a thief?

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:03.960
I must say, I was very surprised.

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:07.960
I was surprised too,

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:10.090
Lupin III.

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:13.290
Oh, you know that name?

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:16.600
I may not look like one, but I'm a thief too.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:20.120
You're the grandson of Lupin I,

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:21.820
also known as the Great Thief.

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:25.460
You send out such frank calling cards,

00:06:26.770 --> 00:06:29.440
yet never fail to get what you're after.

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:37.040
I can't believe I found such a superstar of the underworld

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:40.160
in a place as remote as this.

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:42.880
Hey, Lupin...

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:43.470
I—

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:45.290
Mine Fujiko.

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:49.420
Using your seductive charm, you greedily steal whatever you want.

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:52.180
A female thief who recently gained notoriety.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:54.510
I'm honored to meet you.

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:56.550
You're well-informed.

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:59.330
I love to study.

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:03.230
The Fraulein Hoyle Cult.

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:07.450
The followers bathe in the ashes that emanate from the founder's body

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:10.610
and willingly give themselves over to the pleasure that surges through their brains.

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:13.700
It's a form of mass hypnotism.

00:07:14.310 --> 00:07:16.440
Fraulein Hoyle Tower.

00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:19.650
The believers who live in this community

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:24.560
donate everything they own to indulge in the pleasure of the drug.

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:28.090
It wasn't easy to infiltrate this place.

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:33.260
The secret formula of the dizziness drug

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:37.180
is only unveiled for special events,

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:40.470
and the founder's pendant is the key.

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:43.980
The drug's secret formula is the ash itself.

00:07:44.510 --> 00:07:46.840
So you were going to kidnap the leader?

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:48.980
There's a trick to it of course.

00:07:49.470 --> 00:07:54.050
The drug's powerful effects allow him to control so many followers.

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:56.240
What do you think it would be worth on the street?

00:07:56.920 --> 00:07:59.370
I was going to take advantage of the wedding ceremony to steal it.

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:02.800
Or so I thought, but then you showed up.

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:06.250
That goes for both of us.

00:08:07.370 --> 00:08:10.640
Well, stealing is more fun when you have a rival.

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:13.260
What about you? Can you do anything other than seduce people?

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:16.010
Something that can compete on my level?

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:19.010
Perhaps.

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:23.560
That may be all I have.

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:32.190
Oh my, how daring!

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:35.460
If I gave my body to my rival,

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:37.530
perhaps we could agree to split the profits?

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:40.410
That's not too bad, but it wouldn't be very fun.

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:43.440
How about if I team up with him,

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:46.160
or pretend to, so that I can get ahead of him?

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:53.040
What are you doing?

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:56.930
Help me!

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:58.720
He tried to...

00:08:58.720 --> 00:08:59.630
Huh?

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:00.830
Wait a minute here.

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:03.310
You're the one who started stripping!

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:04.560
Take him away!

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:06.720
Hey!

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:07.890
This isn't fair!

00:09:07.890 --> 00:09:09.350
Give me a break!

00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:11.220
Ow, ow, ow!

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:14.660
Thank you. You saved me.

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:16.070
Well, uh...

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:18.490
I understand.

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:22.450
Even if you save me now, my life will vanish tomorrow.

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:29.410
No, I didn't mean...!

00:09:30.490 --> 00:09:33.720
I'm going to disappear anyway.

00:09:45.740 --> 00:09:47.720
The time has come!

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:56.440
These insects are frozen into immobility by sin! Exterminate them!

00:09:56.810 --> 00:09:58.990
First, the male insect!

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:02.820
Followed by the female insect!

00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:11.960
Oh, pitiful woman.

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:14.750
I will give your corpse one last kiss.

00:10:19.850 --> 00:10:24.510
Glimmer, shimmer!

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:28.430
Stealing is more fun when you have a rival.

00:10:28.430 --> 00:10:30.760
Isn't that right, Lupin?

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:33.400
No hard feelings, okay?

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:47.790
I... was tricked by a terrifying woman...

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:51.790
and died!

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:06.300
But tricking someone is more fun than being tricked.

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:14.650
There we go!

00:11:16.310 --> 00:11:17.720
What's going on?

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:19.570
Look at this!

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:21.780
What? It's a dummy!

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:23.150
Th-They're up there!

00:11:29.390 --> 00:11:31.530
So you kill people too?

00:11:31.530 --> 00:11:33.460
I only do it when it's necessary!

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:35.580
I see.

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:37.210
Necessary, huh?

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:40.710
I've got it.

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:42.400
Let's have a contest.

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:43.880
A contest?

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:49.390
Let's see which one of us can get the secret formula first!

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:54.050
Hey, there he is!

00:11:58.190 --> 00:12:00.480
Don't disappoint me,

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:34.730
Mine Fujiko!

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:36.750
And that man!

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:39.010
They're making fun of me.

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:44.230
No matter what they try, they'll
never steal my secret formula.

00:12:54.530 --> 00:12:58.190
Breasts glimmer, legs shimmer.

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:00.790
Thighs tingle!

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:03.790
Glisten, glitter.

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:05.980
Tremble, quiver.

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:11.050
Shake, shiver!

00:13:15.470 --> 00:13:16.510
Wh-What?

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:18.260
I knew it.

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:20.660
I realized it after kissing you.

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:23.560
The drug doesn't work on you.

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:24.200
You...!

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:28.160
It's okay. That was just a sleeping drug.

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:33.240
Different from the Frauline Hoyle "dizziness" ash that you use.

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:38.610
You mix Fraulein Hoyle in with sodium acetate.

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:40.660
It's highly soluble.

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:44.600
You paint a thick layer of the resulting solution all over your body.

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:49.380
If you brush it off, it immediately crystallizes.

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:53.310
Oh, it melted off.

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:56.570
The drawback is that it can't withstand heat.

00:13:57.430 --> 00:13:59.830
You drug up your followers,

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:02.290
all while claiming to be a priest with divine powers.

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:04.310
What an awful cult leader.

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:08.050
Now, open the path to the sanctuary.

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:09.770
Don't forget your pendant, either.

00:14:12.510 --> 00:14:13.610
<i>Lupin,</i>

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:16.360
<i>how are you going to do it?</i>

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:19.910
<i>Mine Fujiko, huh?</i>

00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:22.420
<i>What a crazy woman.</i>

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:26.000
<i>She recklessly went alone into such a dangerous place just for some narcotics,</i>

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:29.300
<i>and she's capable of killing without hesitation.</i>

00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:34.050
<i>She's a masochist who doesn't care how low she has to go.</i>

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:36.610
<i>Not bad at all.</i>

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:40.940
Oh, my!

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:45.340
A narcotics production facility.

00:14:45.340 --> 00:14:47.940
The secret formula lies further in.

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:49.960
However...

00:14:49.960 --> 00:14:53.860
I can't hand it over to an immobile worm like you!

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:06.960
Burn this motionless insect to death!

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:20.760
Don't hesitate!

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:22.900
Kill Mine Fujiko!

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.540
If all you do is howl...

00:15:25.530 --> 00:15:27.750
Open Sesame!

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:30.620
Wha—?

00:15:30.620 --> 00:15:33.050
Hurry and open it!

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:34.950
I can't!

00:15:35.420 --> 00:15:37.170
The switch isn't working!

00:15:55.400 --> 00:15:56.830
That's...

00:15:56.830 --> 00:15:58.340
Could that be...?

00:15:58.340 --> 00:16:03.430
Yeah, that's 100 percent pure Fraulein Hoyle crystal.

00:16:03.800 --> 00:16:08.440
This cult must be pretty happy that they get the source of the drug all to themselves.

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:10.870
How did you get here?

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:12.340
What are you gonna do now?

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:13.940
Settle our contest?

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:18.490
I expected as much from you, Lupin.

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:25.320
I'm disappointed, Mine Fujiko.

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:28.760
Acting desperate isn't something a fine woman should do.

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:29.820
You're right.

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:32.130
But I'm not a fine woman.

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:39.240
You said as much, didn't you?

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:40.050
I'm...

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:45.700
an <i>extraordinarily</i> fine woman!

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:52.130
I win, Lupin!

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:56.100
It won't matter how much you run.

00:16:57.020 --> 00:16:59.250
What an interesting woman.

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:00.370
<i>More than I ever imagined.</i>

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:02.790
Come on, let's settle this!

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:12.160
Hey, where are you touching?!

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:16.300
Founder, the police...

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:18.050
The police?!

00:17:20.920 --> 00:17:21.810
Inspector Zenigata.

00:17:22.530 --> 00:17:24.590
Do you really think Lupin III is here?

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:25.530
Yeah.

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:30.030
I found out that the drug is being smuggled in from this island.

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:34.040
Then why haven't we investigated this place before?

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:38.600
The bigger the bait to lure Lupin in, the better.

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:41.540
When that bug gets lured in by the food,

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:45.740
we'll arrest him along with everyone else on the feeding ground.

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:47.790
Understand, Oscar?

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:51.130
Yes, sir!

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:53.600
You sent a calling card?

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:56.170
Why would you shoot yourself in the foot like that?

00:17:57.150 --> 00:18:00.380
I'm tired of just plain stealing.

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:02.070
Tired?

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:06.100
There are buoyancy tanks under here.

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:07.270
Buoyancy tanks?

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:10.270
Yeah. This is an isolated island community.

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:14.650
They turned an ocean platform into a makeshift island

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:17.780
and built a shrine on it.

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:19.780
It's designed so that the drugs synthesized here

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:23.780
can be taken out through a secret entrance to the ocean.

00:18:26.740 --> 00:18:31.290
<i>I can't have you forgetting the other function of this sea platform!</i>

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:34.820
It creates an alibi by erasing all of our sins!

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:36.800
Let it all sink to the bottom of the sea!

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:46.560
This lovely dizziness will set your heart on fire.

00:18:57.600 --> 00:18:58.820
Wait, Lupin!

00:19:10.360 --> 00:19:12.400
Serves you right, thieves!

00:19:13.770 --> 00:19:15.580
Hey, good work.

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:18.590
Huh?!

00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:23.710
Lupin?

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:38.690
What?

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:45.200
I win, Mine Fujiko!

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:51.080
I'm not such an easy woman.

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:56.460
Whoa, whoa!

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:05.920
Take this!

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:10.680
Too bad!

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:11.810
That's my line!

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:34.620
Oh, no! It'll melt!

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:38.020
Too bad.

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:39.880
Well, whatever.

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:42.440
Hey, come on!

00:20:42.440 --> 00:20:45.130
It'll put you in a real good mood!

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:49.640
Arrest them all!

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:51.640
Inspector Zenigata!

00:20:52.260 --> 00:20:54.090
We can't proceed any further!

00:20:55.680 --> 00:20:57.140
Lupin...

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:10.610
<i>Really...</i>

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:12.870
<i>If only he hadn't appeared...</i>

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:19.590
<i>"I will steal Mine Fujiko."</i>

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:21.380
<i>—Lupin III.</i>

00:21:21.940 --> 00:21:23.380
<i>Back then...</i>

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:26.460
<i>Lupin III.</i>

00:21:29.030 --> 00:21:30.840
Mine Fujiko.

00:21:30.840 --> 00:21:34.720
This extraordinarily fine woman is the cure to my boredom.

00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:41.000
The next time we meet, I'll...
